# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on the CPU
# (D198), scenario double of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# NVT and NPT runs with drawn velocities and restraints against `mdir run`
# of the same control file in double precision, and the effect of the
# restraints and of their reference.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU mdir mdir-model-test %t double | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVT: the restraints change the potential
# CHECK: NPT: the restraints change the potential
# CHECK: velocities and restraints double passed
